  chapter: "Antenatal Care",
  level: "Easy",
  q: "A 24-year-old primigravida presents for her first booking antenatal visit at 10 weeks of gestation. Her past medical history is unremarkable, and she takes no medications. Which of the following supplements is recommended primarily to prevent neural tube defects in her fetus?",
