  wrongExp: "• <strong>Option A (Oxytocin):</strong> Oxytocin is the first-line uterotonic for PPH and is safe in asthmatic patients.<br>• <strong>Option B (Methylergonovine):</strong> Methergine causes smooth muscle constriction and is contraindicated in patients with hypertension or preeclampsia due to the risk of stroke/seizure, but it is not contraindicated in asthma.<br>• <strong>Option D (Misoprostol):</strong> Misoprostol is a prostaglandin E1 analogue that is safe to use in asthmatics for PPH."
